### Tender → quote → award (development plan phases 2 and 3), nag (Dispatcher) and satish (CarrierDesk)
# Start `cds watch`, then run the requests top to bottom (VS Code REST Client).
# Every step can be done in the apps instead: nag in the Dispatch Cockpit
# (/tm.dispatch.dispatchcockpit/index.html), satish in the Tender Desk
# (/tm.dispatch.tenderdesk/index.html). The quote requests pick up whatever
# invitations are open for {{order}}.

@server = http://localhost:4004
@dispatch = {{server}}/odata/v4/dispatch
@tender = {{server}}/odata/v4/tender
@nag = Basic nag:
@satish = Basic satish:
@order = 6100000005

### nag: open the order (creates its dispatch, NEW)
# @name openOrder
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders('{{order}}')?$select=TransportationOrder,dispatchStatus&$expand=dispatch($select=ID)
Authorization: {{nag}}

### nag: start a PEER round with three carriers (PEER can be awarded before the deadline;
### BROADCAST only after it has passed)
POST {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders('{{order}}')/DispatchService.startTender
Authorization: {{nag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "PEER", "deadline": "2099-12-31T12:00:00Z", "carriers": ["10300001", "10300002", "10300003"] }

### satish: open invitations of the order (INVITED, round open, deadline not passed),
### with lane and dates from TM and the countdown (deadlineCriticality, timeLeft)
# @name invitations
GET {{tender}}/OpenInvitations?$filter=freightOrderId eq '{{order}}'&$orderby=carrierId
Authorization: {{satish}}

@offer1 = {{invitations.response.body.$.value[0].ID}}
@offer2 = {{invitations.response.body.$.value[1].ID}}
@offer3 = {{invitations.response.body.$.value[2].ID}}

### satish: quote for the first carrier
POST {{tender}}/OpenInvitations({{offer1}})/TenderService.submitQuote
Authorization: {{satish}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 1450.00, "currency": "EUR", "transitHours": 20, "comment": "Quoted by phone" }

### satish: a cheaper quote for the second carrier
POST {{tender}}/OpenInvitations({{offer2}})/TenderService.submitQuote
Authorization: {{satish}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 1290.50, "currency": "EUR", "transitHours": 26, "comment": "Quoted by mail" }

### satish: the third carrier declines
POST {{tender}}/OpenInvitations({{offer3}})/TenderService.decline
Authorization: {{satish}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comment": "No capacity that week" }

### satish: the quoted invitation is gone from the list, but a read by key shows it as QUOTED
GET {{tender}}/OpenInvitations({{offer1}})
Authorization: {{satish}}

### Rule check: an offer is quoted only once (expect 400 OFFER_NOT_INVITED)
POST {{tender}}/OpenInvitations({{offer1}})/TenderService.submitQuote
Authorization: {{satish}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 999, "currency": "EUR", "transitHours": 10 }

### nag is refused on TenderService (expect 403)
GET {{tender}}/OpenInvitations
Authorization: {{nag}}

### satish is refused on DispatchService (expect 403), and cannot award (expect 403)
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders?$top=1
Authorization: {{satish}}

###
POST {{dispatch}}/CarrierOffers(ID={{offer2}},IsActiveEntity=true)/DispatchService.award
Authorization: {{satish}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### nag: the list row shows best quote 1290.50 EUR and 2 quotes
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders?$filter=TransportationOrder eq '{{order}}'&$select=TransportationOrder,dispatchStatus,bestQuote,bestQuoteCurrency,quoteCount,quoteDeadline
Authorization: {{nag}}

### nag: award the cheaper quote (offer 2): WON, offer 1 LOST, round closed, dispatch AWARDED
POST {{dispatch}}/CarrierOffers(ID={{offer2}},IsActiveEntity=true)/DispatchService.award
Authorization: {{nag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### nag: the header data: status, awarded carrier and price
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders('{{order}}')?$select=TransportationOrder,dispatchStatus&$expand=dispatch($select=awardedCarrier,awardedPrice,currency_code,awardedBy,awardedAt)
Authorization: {{nag}}

### nag: the round with its offers
GET {{dispatch}}/Dispatch(ID={{openOrder.response.body.dispatch.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/rounds?$expand=offers($select=carrierId,carrierName,status_code,price,currency_code,transitHours,respondedAt,comment)
Authorization: {{nag}}
